-subscriber concurrently and aggregates ack times. The dedicated safety
-audit suite (Teammate S) asserts ``max_ack_ms < 2000`` on a real run
-with 7 brokers + 3 workflows + 2 pending paper proposals — instrumented,
-not approximated.
